  <!--English=Assembly success chance-->
  <MR_Stat_SuccessChanceOffset>조립 성공 확률</MR_Stat_SuccessChanceOffset>
  <!--English=Added to the success chance of the mechanoid recycler this accelerator is linked to.\n\nA recycler draws from one accelerator of each type; all three together make a run certain.-->
