  <!--English=Changes here take effect after restarting the game.-->
  <MR_Settings_ImplantsRestart>변경 사항은 게임을 재시작한 뒤 적용됩니다.</MR_Settings_ImplantsRestart>
  <!--English=Restart the game to apply these changes.-->
  <MR_Settings_ImplantsRestartNow>변경 사항을 적용하려면 게임을 재시작하세요.</MR_Settings_ImplantsRestartNow>
  <!--English=Uncontrolled implant efficiency: {0}-->
